; the cache of the State Repository as its service keeps it for a machine without packages: every table with its data and
; its indexes, empty, and the two users every machine has, the system account and the null sid the provisioned
; packages belong to. Windows.StateRepositoryCore.dll reads it for the launcher and the shell, which find no packaged
; handler in it. tables and indexes as a windows 11 26100 machine has them.

